{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56581","headline":"九转诗 九 · 窦真君","name":"九转诗 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律春初至，金丹帝感成。\n南山同圣寿，东海比时清。\n福是玄元德，功由至道呈。\n小臣虽有术，仙士谢茅盈。\n（《还丹诗诀》卷上。\n原署「峨眉窦真人」，与真君应爲同一人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}